 "lines": {
  "n1": [
   "Once upon a time, a girl named Cinderella swept the cinders all day long.",
   "从前，有个叫灰姑娘的女孩，整天都在打扫炉灰。"
  ],
  "n2": [
   "Her stepmother dumped the laundry on her, then left for the royal ball.",
   "继母把一大堆脏衣服丢给她，就去参加王宫舞会了。"
  ],
  "n3": [
   "Poof! Her fairy godmother appeared. But her magic wand turned the broom into a chicken!",
   "“噗”的一声，仙女教母出现了。可她的魔杖一挥，扫帚竟变成了一只鸡！"
  ],
  "n4": [
   "Let's try again! The pumpkin became a golden carriage, and her rags became a lovely gown.",
   "再来一次！南瓜变成了金色马车，破衣裳变成了漂亮的礼服。"
  ],
  "n5": [
   "At the ball, the prince was speechless. They danced and danced, and the sisters were furious.",
   "舞会上，王子看得说不出话来。他们跳了一支又一支舞，姐姐们气坏了。"
  ],
  "n6": [
   "But at midnight, the clock struck twelve. She ran away and lost a glass slipper.",
   "可是到了午夜，钟声敲响十二下。她慌忙跑开，掉了一只玻璃鞋。"
  ],
  "n7": [
   "The prince searched every house. A stepsister tried to squeeze her foot in. No luck!",
   "王子挨家挨户地找。一个姐姐拼命把脚往鞋里塞，可就是穿不进去！"
  ],
  "n8": [
   "Then Cinderella tried it on. It was a perfect fit! The end.",
   "灰姑娘一试，正好合脚！故事讲完啦。"
  ]
 },
